  "description": "Attribute-based NATS service framework for .NET — write NATS / JetStream consumers like ASP.NET controllers. Subject routing by attribute, JSON/Protobuf payloads, at-least-once JetStream delivery with redelivery backoff and a dead-letter subject, native request-reply RPC, and full passthrough to the underlying NATS.Net (auth/TLS) configuration.",
  "id": "Irkalla.Nats",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-07-12T07:46:13.277Z",
